  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Justice Sector Reform Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Justice Sector Reform Support - The proposed action in The Gambia aims to contribute to sustainable and inclusive growth by consolidating democracy and rule of law, improving migration management, strengthening social protection, and improving public finance management. It targets SDG 16 but also significantly targets SDG 5, 1, and 10. Complementary support measures include technical assistance and a call for proposals to test a universal social protection model focused on vulnerable groups. The action is part of the Team Europe Initiative &quot;Good Governance&quot; and will form the basis for regular policy dialogue with the Gambian government. It also contributes to the EU Gender Action Plan 2021-2025.</narrative>
  </description>
